OL,3,AHundreds mourn police officer killed in
OL,4,AA66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on behalf of his family,
OL,7,FCleveland Police Federation chair
OL,8,FLauren Somerville said "life feels
OL,9,Funbearably quiet" without the
OL,10,Ffather-of-two's "silly jokes" and
OL,11,Flaughter.
